#Nita First Battle Post-Win Dialouge
#Dialogue231
#/tedit add WIN /scoreboard players set @pl DialogueTrigger 231

tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=231,TalkTime=5}] {"text":"<Nita> Would you look at the cut of me Pokémon!"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=231,TalkTime=13}] {"text":"<Nita> What a battle, and me not trying for real even!"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=231,TalkTime=21}] {"text":"<Nita> Oh, I'm scarlet for you, pet. Made a complete and utter hash o' that one, didn't you now?"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=231,TalkTime=31}] {"text":"<Nita> But get you a bit more training, and you'll be grand. Trust me, training's your only man."}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=231,TalkTime=41}] {"text":"<Nita> The Battle Maison and Nita are both here and waiting for a challenge every day o' the year!"}]
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=231,TalkTime=51}] {"text":"<Nita> We'll always be waiting for you! See you then!"}]
