#Dialogue270 - Ribbon Tourist Monday Gave ribbon
#Ribbon Tourist

tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=270,TalkTime=1}] {"text":"<Tourist> When you're all perked up, everything goes well!"}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=270,TalkTime=8}] {"text":"<Tourist> If you're feeling down, just take a gander at an Alert Ribbon, and you'll feel better in no time!"}

