#Dialogue271
#Ribbon Tourist Tuesday
#/tedit add INTERACT /scoreboard players set @pl DialogueTrigger 271

tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=271,TalkTime=1}] {"text":"<Tourist> Have you ever had something happen that really scared or surprised you?"}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=271,TalkTime=10}] {"text":"<Tourist> It's important to not forget that feeling. That's why I'm going to give your Pokémon a Shock Ribbon!"}
tellraw @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=271,TalkTime=22}] {"text":"<Tourist> Send out your Pokémon and I'll pin a ribbon on them!"}

tag @s[scores={DialogueTrigger=271,TalkTime=22..}] add Dialogue271
